      <activity id="95439d04-9484-5aa3-ab86-4491a21328e1" activityNameId="4f3160e0-7a45-5f6f-8ca3-d0259a4cb4f9" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Tailings, uranium milling</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Tailings, uranium milling
The model for radioactive emissions may not reflect specific conditions nor its results be suitable for comparison with environmental impact appraisals of single uranium mills. Hence, great prudence should be taken when analysing results for the uranium milling step as well as the complete nuclear energy chain.;
UUID: 1dee7204-4bef-489f-ad8e-d8e2d0352214
The module includes the land use of tailings, the long term emission of Rn-222 and radioactive isotopes to surface water (assumption). Non radioactive emissions are separately included with the dataset "disposal, uranium tailings, non-radiolactive emissions".
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Average conditions.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1dee7204-4bef-489f-ad8e-d8e2d0352214.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
